&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Degree: &lt;/strong&gt;In Technology &amp;amp; Management, Industrial/Business Engineering, Business Informatics, Computer Science, Mathematics, Economics or a comparable degree program&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Native-level or near-native German language skills (written and spoken), with the ability to confidently engage German-speaking customers, facilitate workshops, and present to executive stakeholders.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
