&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernization, connecting strategy directly to execution. Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. VML, part of WPP, supports WPP Enterprise Solutions by helping brands activate transformation through creativity and experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Senior Consultant with experience in Commerce ecosystems and technologies wanted to join our Business Services team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The opportunity:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How consumers discover, evaluate and buy products is changing faster than most organisations can respond. AI-powered search, agentic commerce, generative product discovery and the collapse of the traditional funnel are reshaping commercial models across every sector. Most enterprise clients know something has shifted, few have a clear plan for what to do about it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions is building a commerce consulting practice to help clients navigate these shifts. We work with some of the world&#39;s most recognised brands, translating complex commercial challenges into actionable strategies, transformation roadmaps and delivery programmes. What makes this role different from a boutique or a SaaS provider is what sits around you: your consulting recommendations connect directly to creative, content, CX and commerce execution teams who bring them to life. Strategy doesn&#39;t end at a slide deck here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Consultant who can own projects and client relationships. Someone who takes an ambiguous brief, structures it independently, drives the strategic direction and ensures the quality of everything the team delivers. You&#39;ll lead client conversations, design and facilitate workshops, and be the person mid-to-senior client stakeholders trust to connect diagnostic findings to commercial action. You&#39;ll also play a key role in growing the practice, spotting extension opportunities within accounts, contributing to pitches and coaching more junior members of the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perm&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;London/Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel to client site where required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Leadership &amp;amp; Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own medium-scale projects end-to-end: scope, quality, delivery timeline, and client relationship. Accountable for the strategic direction and the standard of output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of strategic recommendations across commerce transformation, AI discoverability (GEO/AEO), agentic commerce readiness, content strategy and channel optimisation - shaping the narrative, not just building the analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ambiguous or loosely defined briefs and structure them into clear project plans with defined deliverables, milestones and resource requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and codify delivery methodologies into repeatable, scalable frameworks the wider team can execute against.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and lead workshops, stakeholder interviews and co-creation sessions. You will be comfortable going off-script when the conversation requires it and steering senior client stakeholders toward actionable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor to mid-to-senior client contacts. You are the person they call when they need the thinking sharpened or the direction challenged.&lt;br&gt;Anticipate and respond to client questions in a compelling and informed way. Own the client relationship day-to-day, identifying when senior escalation or support is needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify growth opportunities within existing accounts - spot the extension, the adjacent brief, the unasked question and work with senior leadership to convert them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute meaningfully to proposals and pitch responses: shaping the strategic approach, writing key sections, and presenting to prospective clients where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build client relationships that generate repeat work - not just deliver well, but leave clients wanting more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team &amp;amp; Practice Building:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and develop Consultants on the team: Setting the quality bar on projects, giving direct feedback, and creating opportunities for junior team members to stretch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role may line-manage 1–2 team members, depending on team structure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive practice IP development: reusable frameworks, case studies, proposition collateral and points of view that strengthen our market position and make selling easier.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across WPP&#39;s integrated network: connecting upstream consulting recommendations to downstream execution in content, CX and commerce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we want from you:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive professional experience, with a strong track record in consulting, strategy or senior commercial/digital roles (ideally blending both)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of how commerce ecosystems work: You&#39;ve either run a commerce operation (brand-side) or advised on one (agency/consulting-side). You understand how trading, content, category management, channel strategy and technology intersect in practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of AI discoverability: GEO, AEO, LLM-influenced discovery, AI assistants and conversational commerce. You can advise a Head of Digital or VP of eCommerce on what this shift means for their business and back it up with a credible action plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead projects independently - you&#39;ve managed scope, quality and client expectations without someone looking over your shoulder.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong strategic and analytical thinking: you can take a diagnostic output or a data-heavy assessment and turn it into a clear, commercially prioritised set of recommendations with a compelling narrative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and executive presence - you&#39;re comfortable leading a room, running a workshop, and navigating a difficult client conversation with credibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building methodology or practice IP: You&#39;ve created frameworks, playbooks or delivery approaches that others have adopted and scaled.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideally you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brand-side experience in eCommerce, digital marketing or commercial leadership - you&#39;ve lived the reality of managing a P&amp;amp;L, running a digital operation, or leading a commerce team. This perspective is what separates a genuine consultant from a presenter of slides.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in at least two of: CPG/FMCG, Consumer health, Automotive, Retail, Telecom.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change management or enablement experience: you&#39;ve helped organisations adopt new operating models, not just designed them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Line management or mentoring experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you know some of this, even better:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on curiosity with AI tools LLMs, agentic platforms, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with commerce technology (Shopify, SFCC, Commercetools, PIM/DAM systems).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we can offer you:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to shape a growing consulting practice your work will define methodology and propositions, not just execute someone else&#39;s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct access to iconic enterprise clients and the opportunity to contribute to both proposition development and project delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An integrated agency network where your consulting work connects to creative, content, CX and commerce teams who make the recommendations real.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team culture that values intellectual honesty, pace and ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;London-based with flexible hybrid working and occasional client travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training, development, and a clear path to Senior Consultant and beyond.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Permanent only&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer a great benefits package including a discretionary bonus scheme, training opportunities, competitive pension, medical insurance, life assurance, social events, opportunities to buy and sell holidays, family friendly policies, discounts with hundreds of retailers and much more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our culture thrives on our core values, designed for impact-driven individuals: Heart, Brains and Courage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We lead with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Heart&lt;/strong&gt;, fostering empathy and trust where genuine connections and human-centric work flourish.&lt;br&gt;We empower your&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Brains&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for innovation, valuing relentless curiosity and collaborative intelligence to solve complex challenges.&lt;br&gt;And we champion&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Courage&lt;/strong&gt;, inspiring you to speak up, embrace experimentation, and advocate for bold solutions that push our thinking to be better than yesterday.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;At&amp;nbsp; WPP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt; Enterprise Solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernisation, connecting strategy directly to execution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX, work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We have received distinction as a leader in Commerce Services and CX Strategy Consulting by the Forrester Wave™&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;To find out more&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://enterprisesolutions.wpp.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;enterprisesolutions.wpp.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; and follow us on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/wpp-enterprise-solutions&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions is part of &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/wpp.com/__;!!IfJP2Nwhk5Z0yJ43lA!L_cfT4E3gsmmDY1lVQTB6ihlfPeBl9X4sMM2KI6iWZYexC2nCeZ9oxgP9qvgbrqxIBpx82rGb_mWqh5F0zKxq5_dP7Y$&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WPP&lt;/a&gt;, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence and world-class partnerships – all united by our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions). Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Auth0 Sales Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Auth0 supports Okta’s vision of freeing anyone to safely use any technology by providing a secure, highly available, enterprise-grade platform that secures billions of log-ins every year for Consumers and SaaS applications. This team in the UKI is growing exponentially with net new growth headcount being released to support the demand in the market.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Auth0 &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Account Executive Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an &lt;strong&gt;Auth0 Enterprise Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll play a pivotal role in expanding our footprint and driving significant revenue growth in the &lt;strong&gt;Public Sector&lt;/strong&gt;. You&#39;ll be instrumental in demonstrating the profound value of our platform to &lt;strong&gt;Application Development teams&lt;/strong&gt;, including &lt;strong&gt;Engineering, Product, Security, and Architecture leaders&lt;/strong&gt;. This isn&#39;t just about closing deals; it&#39;s about building lasting partnerships, identifying new opportunities, and nurturing existing customer relationships to ensure their continued success and expansion with Auth0.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive New Business Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively generate and nurture top-of-funnel activity to create a robust pipeline of new customer opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master the Sales Cycle:&lt;/strong&gt; Execute every sales engagement with precision, leveraging a methodical and controlled sales approach to navigate complex deals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Territory Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and execute comprehensive territory plans, demonstrating strong operational excellence and delivering accurate forecasts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engage Technical Audiences:&lt;/strong&gt; Employ a sophisticated &quot;bottom-up, top-down&quot; strategy to effectively target and engage Developers, Engineering Leaders and other technical stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Achieve and Exceed Targets:&lt;/strong&gt; Skilfully scope, negotiate, and close agreements, consistently meeting and exceeding your revenue quota.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cultivate Internal Partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and foster strong, collaborative relationships within your Okta ecosystem, including SDRs, Pre-Sales, and Customer Success teams, to ensure seamless customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver Value-Driven Insights:&lt;/strong&gt; Adopt a compelling, value-based sales approach, consistently bringing a unique and insightful point of view to every customer interaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect In-Person:&lt;/strong&gt; Travel as needed to meet with customers, building stronger relationships and understanding their unique needs firsthand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Enterprise SaaS Sales Success:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrable track record of successfully selling complex enterprise SaaS products to large organisations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Sales Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Significant experience and comfort selling to highly technical customer profiles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to educate and create demand with C-level decision-makers, effectively articulating the business value of Auth0.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hunter Mentality:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong experience and a clear passion for acquiring and then expanding new logo accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complex Deal Navigation:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to navigate intricate sales cycles involving multiple stakeholders, both within the customer organisation and your internal ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Curiosity:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong technical aptitude and an insatiable curiosity to continuously learn and understand new technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Framework Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated expertise in utilising a structured sales framework such as &lt;strong&gt;MEDDPICC, Challenger, or Sandler&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
