&lt;span class=&quot;heading-anchor-wrapper css-v48shi&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;69dd54a9-2ef5-431f-8297-07239e2f2358&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;675&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1cd712909f49&quot;&gt;Coordinate customer delivery from contract signing to go-live, working with Infrastructure and Engineering on technical readiness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;809&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f46905457cc1&quot;&gt;Agree on timelines, delivery scope, and launch success criteria with customers and Sales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;902&quot; data-local-id=&quot;05f8437ef736&quot;&gt;Lead the pre-sales and delivery &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;TPM&lt;/span&gt; team: set priorities, assign ownership, hire and develop people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1006&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e31e786d588b&quot;&gt;Align launch plans with Infrastructure and Engineering based on capacity and readiness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1097&quot; data-local-id=&quot;336aa11f6aa8&quot;&gt;Manage delivery risks and delays, including their impact on contracts, billing, and customer commitments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1206&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0ae4071fe9ca&quot;&gt;Handle escalations and difficult discussions&amp;nbsp;together with Sales and other leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1293&quot; data-local-id=&quot;77a4a2ef86ad&quot;&gt;Ensure regular customer updates and a clear handover of commitments to post-sales teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1385&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9e6eb697c8d7&quot;&gt;Creation of deployment process documentation for customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1448&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f9535aa8d1e6&quot;&gt;Report on deliveries to &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;GTM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; leadership, agree on priorities, and act on feedback.&lt;/p&gt;
